{
  "text": "My goal has always been to serve others. That's the foundation of everything I do as a real estate agent. Yes, I curate content, you see me show up online consistently, but that is purely intentional for my clients. God has blessed me with this platform, a community full of real estate agents around the world, buyers locally and out of state. And what that means for my clients is real urgency. Before a listing ever hits the market, buyers already know it's coming. I'll build this to serve you, to glorify God, and to create a system that will work harder for you than the average agent ever will. So, when these posts come across your feed, just know, behind every single one are 14 hour days, late night phone calls, and me pouring everything I have into the best possible strategy for you and your family.",
